.devbox/
/live_render
*_pw_gen.go
# pw generate rebuilds everything here: the Tailwind output and the
# content-hashed component assets the generator extracts. A committed copy
# drifts from the sources it was scanned from, and an extracted name carries
# a content hash, so a change orphans the previous file rather than replacing
# it. A package inverts this; see decision:generated-public-asset-version-control.
public/generated/
public/**/*.zstd
# pw prepare and pw build write the derived asset tree here. The directory
# itself is kept, because public.go embeds it and an embed of a missing
# directory does not compile.
dist/cache/
dist/derived/
dist/manifest.json
dist/routes.json
dist/public/*
!dist/public/.keep
